							Guild Charter
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Eternal Redemption is guild dedicated to helping others and each other. We do not believe in what a guild can do for us but more of what we can do for the guild. We are all family and all proud to be together as helpers of Norrath. We are now also a role-playing guild. This means that in guildchat we speak in OOC (out of character), but when we meet each other we will be in character role-play mode. We are a small family at the moment but are growing slowly as only the finest members can join our ranks. If you have heard of us before the chances are you will know us as the good guys. We see to and help people out first and don't look at loot as a reason for being in a guild. If you want to be rich or get &quot;phat loot&quot; as they say then we have no place for you. If you are a kind and caring person and are good at being there for people in their hour of need then you are the person we are looking for. Please see our members main homepage at http://www.noggy.net/er to see who our officers and members are. We have a few rules of course but they have all been discussed and agreed upon amongst all and I am sure they will apeal to you too so go and have a look at the site now.<br />
<br />
